Third-party work
----------------
Parts of this project build on, call or modify code from the OpenFront game
(OpenFrontIO), which is licensed under AGPL-3.0. That code remains copyright
of its original authors. The files below contain our modifications or
additions and are distributed under the same license:
  - bot/BotExecution.ts, bot/v34/BotExecution.ts (bot built on the game's
    Nation AI behaviors; modified 2026)
  - bot/harness/* (headless test scripts that run the game engine)
  - engine-patch/autoplay.patch (a patch to the game; modified 2026)
  - userscript/* (bundles the game engine when you build it)
The game itself is not included in this repository. setup.sh and the build
steps download it from its official public source.

If you share a built userscript (userscript/dist/*.user.js), it contains the
game engine code, so AGPL-3.0 requires you to also offer its complete
corresponding source.

